WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Step the feet wide, toes slightly in.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Interlace the fingers behind the back.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Hinge forward and fold, lifting the arms away from the back.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the neck soft.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then rise with a flat back.
